## 8. Indonesia legal-basis map — research baseline, not legal approval

**Assumed jurisdiction:** Republic of Indonesia. **Research check:** 23 November 2026. Recheck the consolidated text, implementing rules, OSS status and sector-specific rules before acting.

| Area | Primary legal reference | HSMART implication | Current evidence state |
|---|---|---|---|
| Yayasan / Foundation | UU 16/2001 on Foundations as amended by UU 28/2004 | A Foundation is a statutory legal entity, not a label for an informal project. Formation, deed, Ministry approval, separated assets and statutory organs must be assessed by a notary/qualified Indonesian legal professional. AI GOV roles do not become statutory organs. | NOT FORMED / NOT REVIEWED |
| Perseroan Terbatas (PT) | UU 40/2007 on Limited Liability Companies, as amended including by UU 6/2023; Article 93 addresses natural-person eligibility for Directors | A PT requires actual natural-person statutory actors and lawful corporate instruments. The internal rule “only GOV-01 human” cannot be used to replace a legally required natural-person Director or other statutory organ. | NOT FORMED / NOT REVIEWED |
| Risk-based business licensing | PP 28/2025 on Risk-Based Business Licensing, which superseded PP 5/2021 | Determine the correct KBLI, risk level, OSS licence/standard certificate and sector approvals for the actual activities before trading or operating a regulated service. | NOT CLASSIFIED / NO OSS LICENCE VERIFIED |
| Personal data | UU 27/2022 on Personal Data Protection | Identify controller/processor roles, lawful processing basis, purpose limitation, transparency, data-subject rights, retention/deletion, security and breach response. Where HSMART acts as processor, define written controller instructions and subprocessor arrangements before processing. | NO CUSTOMER DATA PROCESSING APPROVED |
| Private Electronic System Operator (PSE) | PP 71/2019 and Permenkominfo 5/2020 as amended, including Permenkominfo 10/2021 | Assess whether HSMART's planned private electronic services fall within the PSE registration scope and complete required registration through OSS/Komdigi before operating the relevant service. Do not infer exemption from being an early-stage project. | APPLICABILITY REVIEW OPEN / NOT REGISTERED |
| Copyright and chain of title | UU 28/2014 on Copyright | Copyright protection and economic rights must be traced to actual creators/rightsholders, employment/commission terms, assignments and applicable licences. Repository access or authorship labels alone do not prove HSMART owns all contributions. | CHAIN OF TITLE NOT AUDITED |
| Third-party capabilities | Applicable source, package, model, dataset, API and trademark terms | Check separate permissions to copy, modify, host, execute, distribute, sublicense, use commercially and use marks. Do not infer one permission from another. | PER-PUBLISHER REVIEW REQUIRED |

